Date: Sat, 11 Apr 2026 09:47:19 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix: guard against undefined user in getAllPermissions
 handler

The GET /api/v1/auth/:type route matches /api/v1/auth/resolve, which
is whitelisted and skips authentication. When an unauthenticated
request hits this route, req.user is undefined and accessing
user.isOrganizationAdmin throws a TypeError, returning a 500 error.

Added a null check for req.user that returns 401 before accessing any
user properties. This fixes the login page hang on fresh Flowise 3.x
installs where the UI calls /api/v1/auth/resolve to determine auth
state.

Fixes #6105
